able_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Helo grabbed his younger sister, and led all the cattle to safety despite having none of his own.  "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Linking Words"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use certain words to link sentences together in a narrative."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Narration or an event sequence\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First of all<br/> At first<br/> To begin with<br/> In the beginning<br/> To begin with<br/> Then<br/> Next<br/> Before<br/> After<br/> After that<br/> Afterwards<br/> While<br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"During </br> Soon</br> Immediately</br> Once</br> Suddenly</br> As soon as</br> Finally</br> Eventually</br> At the end</br> In the end</br> At last</br> Until</br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Summing up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To sum up</br> In short</br> In brief</br> Briefly speaking\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressing effect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"So<br>Therefore<br>Thus<br>Consequently\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressing purpose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To<br>So as to<br>In order to <br>So that\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vast "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very great in size, amount, or extent "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Helo often dreamed of having hundreds of cows and vast areas of land."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a story from the past."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stature "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the level of respect that people have for a successful person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example:  Although, Helo wished for wealth and stature in society, he politely declined their offer. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rebel group "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who opposes or fights against a government"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: The rebel group set the village on fire."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "courage "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the ability to do something that you know is difficult or dangerous "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Helo showed a lot of courage."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "goat "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a small animal that is related to the sheep "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: His family owned a few goats."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research an African tribe on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a  80-100 word narrative based on your research."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use linking words and conjunctions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include characters, a setting, a plot and a conclusion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your story to a friend or family member."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research information on African tribes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a narrative."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use linking words and conjunctions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I include characters, a setting, a plot and a conclusion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my story aloud."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le08ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le08ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Once there was a young man named Helo, from the Pokot tribe in Kenya.  In his tribe, a person's wealth was measured by how many cows a family had. As a small child, Helo often dreamed of having hundreds of cows and vast areas of land. Sadly, he was from a poor family, having only a few hungry goats to call their own.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le08ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "During a walk to get fresh water, Helo was approached by some businessmen from the city.  They told him of the riches to be made in far off lands. Although Helo wished for wealth and stature in society, he politely declined their offer. That night he was awoken by the sound of noise and cries.", "id": 2, "time": "23000", "image": "engenn5le08ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Suddenly, the village was set ablaze by a rebel group.  Helo grabbed his younger sister, and led all the cattle to safety despite having none of his own.  The tribe celebrated his thoughtfulness and bravery by singing traditional songs. He was given five cows by the chief.  In the end, his courage was recognized.", "id": 3, "time": "42800", "image": "engenn5le08ob08re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le08ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What is a linking word?</span>", "id": 1, "time": "16000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What are examples of linking words?</span>", "id": 2, "time": "24000", "image": ""}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write a narrative paragraph. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can report about actions, events or people in the past. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write about customs and traditions."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What stories do you know  from the past?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What famous stories are there in your culture? "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next t